1
01:03:51,208 --> 01:03:54,916
<font size="20">I am sure you miss her.</font>

2
01:03:55,500 --> 01:03:57,083
<font size="20">And she misses you.</font>

3
01:03:59,791 --> 01:04:02,791
<font size="20">I miss her… every single day.</font>

4
01:11:26,250 --> 01:11:27,916
<font size="20">So why are you here?</font>

5
01:11:29,125 --> 01:11:31,000
<font size="20">I have something to show you.</font>

6
01:11:31,583 --> 01:11:33,000
<font size="20">Tonight.</font>

7
01:11:33,083 --> 01:11:34,791
<font size="20">After dark.</font>

8
01:11:35,291 --> 01:11:38,375
<font size="20">Meet me in the cemetery. Come alone.</font>

